Z||000000||maryjane||09-15-2001||06:06 PM||||With several PFF members already in the military service, anyone want to start a list<BR>so they can receive letters from some of us. I know they meant something to me when I received them 30yrs ago, even from strangers. I doubt many will always have access to internet. I know DecandenceR just left for Ft Benning Aug 31<BR>Jeff is in Kosovo already. Anybody else?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Wolfhound||09-15-2001||09:45 PM||||Excellent Idea maryjane!||||reg||14
Z||000002||California Kid||09-15-2001||09:50 PM||||Maryjane: Really blows you away about where the last 30 years went doesn't it!!! Like your idea of posting military addresses of the Forum Members on active duty. I did two Wespac Cruises to Viet Nam (70 & 71) on the Carrier USS Oriskany CVA 34, and know exactly what you mean about receiving mail. What I remember, is that even if your name wasn't called during mail call (bummer), everyone who did get mail shared their news from home, even the personal stuff. We were "Brothers In Arms", a true family united.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 09-15-2001).]||||reg||6
Z||000003||Phil||09-15-2001||10:18 PM||||Whoa-- flashbacks||||reg||1
Z||000004||2xsess||09-16-2001||11:25 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>unfortunetly with all the tradgic things going on over there in the states and the mess at the Macedonian border our mail service has bee n highly flaky at best. I'm still waiting on a few inbound birthday packages that were sent almost a week before my birthday (Sept. 10th)<BR>For those of you who don't know about the mess in Macedonia, it's turning into basically what we came to Kosovo to stop, the Albanian population in Macedonia wants more rights, basically they want a part of the country for themselves. Some rebels built a blockade made of rocks and dirt and constantine wire. This blockade stopped supply trucks from coming into Kosovo, imagine that, a few guys with a pile of dirt stopped the supplies of one of the worlds superpowers...amazing. Anyways, the border is reopened now from the last I heard, the R&R trips to Bulgaria have resumed. So hopefully our mail will be coming in a more speedy fashion. Wow, that was a bunch of rambling huh? Sorry.<P>Anyways, My address here is <BR>SPC Jeffrey Kresge<BR>HHC 3/69AR TFF<BR>Camp Montieth<BR>APO AE 09340<P>Don't feel that you have to send anything. I pretty much have internet access at all times. And I've been coming in here more and more often to see what's going on. Especially with the Attack on the WTC and Pentagon. Had to see if any of our family was intact.<P>Thanks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">           <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||1
Z||000005||maryjane||09-16-2001||12:56 PM||||We'll keep your address anyway, even if you don't need anything right now. Any idea when you will get to come back stateside?||||reg||1
Z||000006||2xsess||09-16-2001||03:58 PM||||Thanks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I'm supposedly coming home on the 4th of Nov or sometime there abouts, all you prior service folks know what that means.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">           <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||1
Z||000007||California Kid||09-16-2001||05:25 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 2xsess:<BR><B>Thanks   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I'm supposedly coming home on the 4th of Nov or sometime there abouts, all you prior service folks know what that means.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>2xsess: Thanks for dropping in!! Nice of you to share some of your experiences with us.<P>Best wishes extended to you and all your buddies!!! Hope your travel plans stay solid, but appears we all have to live life one day at a time currently.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_5.jpg"> ||||reg||1
